WEBVTT

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:36.260
I've known all along...

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:39.830
You said you couldn't do anything without me,

00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:43.140
but actually, that wasn't so.

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:48.080
You didn't consider me to be necessary at all, did you, Iruga?

00:00:50.780 --> 00:00:55.240
But now more than ever,
I want to be of service to you.

00:01:01.690 --> 00:01:06.220
Iruga, partake of my life...

00:01:13.330 --> 00:01:15.770
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:01:15.770 --> 00:01:19.740
<i>We dash across the skies</i>

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:22.240
<i>You are my star</i>

00:01:22.240 --> 00:01:26.750
<i>A priceless love</i>

00:01:26.750 --> 00:01:32.550
<i>El Dorado,</i> <i>rising up above the dust clouds</i>

00:01:32.550 --> 00:01:36.490
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:01:40.530 --> 00:01:44.600
<i>The dream I saw before I awoke</i>

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:51.900
<i>Will surely come true, so never forget it</i>

00:01:53.370 --> 00:01:57.450
<i>Searching for a sliver in time passing by</i>

00:01:57.450 --> 00:02:04.580
<i>Where I belong, those days are over now</i>

00:02:06.090 --> 00:02:10.060
<i>Silhouettes outlining the shapes of clouds</i>

00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:12.490
<i>Farther and farther</i>

00:02:12.490 --> 00:02:19.430
<i>I want to keep looking for</i> <i>the promised land I saw in my dreams</i>

00:02:19.430 --> 00:02:21.700
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:25.770
<i>Like a shining arrow</i>

00:02:25.770 --> 00:02:28.280
<i>You are my star</i>

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:32.810
<i>Unfailing strength</i>

00:02:32.810 --> 00:02:38.620
<i>The panorama that spreads before us,</i> <i>beyond the darkness</i>

00:02:38.620 --> 00:02:41.520
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:03:27.570 --> 00:03:29.060
Look...

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:38.110
If you jump that one now, you'll bring many more.

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:45.120
If only I had a bow and arrows,
I could cover you.

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:47.020
But no matter how many we bring down,

00:03:47.020 --> 00:03:49.990
they keep coming back at the sound of the bell- there's no end!

00:03:51.630 --> 00:03:54.460
Okay, we'll take down Wolyafa.

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:55.730
What?

00:03:55.730 --> 00:03:59.430
Wolyafa's bell brings the monsters back to life.

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:02.270
Defeat her, and everything will be over!

00:04:02.270 --> 00:04:03.810
That's impossible!

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:06.440
She lives in the fallen capital nestled between the mountains.

00:04:06.440 --> 00:04:08.840
We'll be killed before we reach there.

00:04:09.980 --> 00:04:11.610
But I still have to go!

00:04:11.610 --> 00:04:15.450
I promised Yuufa that
I would protect Fayon!

00:04:22.460 --> 00:04:24.790
Wait! If we cause a commotion now, they'll...

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:31.300
Damn!

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:35.230
Reflect...

00:04:37.340 --> 00:04:38.830
...Shield!

00:04:51.090 --> 00:04:52.680
At this rate, we'll be...

00:04:56.890 --> 00:04:58.530
Red!

00:04:58.530 --> 00:05:00.190
Green!

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:01.930
Black!

00:05:01.930 --> 00:05:03.730
Yellow!

00:05:03.730 --> 00:05:05.470
Pink!

00:05:05.470 --> 00:05:07.240
Poring!

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:08.900
--Poring!

00:05:08.900 --> 00:05:10.240
Maaya!

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:12.840
Cart...

00:05:12.840 --> 00:05:14.970
--...Revolution!

00:05:22.820 --> 00:05:25.850
I'm back, Big Brother.

00:05:25.850 --> 00:05:29.760
I brought you lots of bows and arrows.

00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:35.960
Magic arrows and iron arrows.
Fire arrows and even silver arrows!

00:05:35.960 --> 00:05:38.000
Thanks!

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:40.800
And I brought healing items, too.

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:45.410
I'll send the bill for everything to the Archer Guild.

00:05:45.410 --> 00:05:47.240
You're going to charge us for them?

00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:49.540
This is business!

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:53.810
But don't worry, I'll give you a discount.

00:06:01.360 --> 00:06:04.830
Okay, let's go! To the fallen capital!

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:06.260
--Right!
--Right!
--Right!

00:06:09.360 --> 00:06:12.700
It's so nice to be young...

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:18.940
Since they're headed there, I'll let them lure the prey out of the hole...

00:06:20.110 --> 00:06:23.040
Yum!

00:06:42.600 --> 00:06:44.030
Fire!

00:06:44.030 --> 00:06:45.470
Fire at will!

00:06:50.240 --> 00:06:51.830
Nine-tailed foxes?!

00:06:59.910 --> 00:07:00.820
Fire!

00:07:00.820 --> 00:07:02.680
Fire! Fire!

00:07:07.820 --> 00:07:09.290
Devotion!

00:07:14.360 --> 00:07:15.900
Stop it!

00:07:15.900 --> 00:07:17.420
--Poring!
--Poring!
--Poring!

00:07:20.070 --> 00:07:21.560
Big Brother!

00:07:23.140 --> 00:07:24.500
Roan-<i>san</i>!

00:07:29.980 --> 00:07:33.470
I can't... take any more!

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:39.050
Heal!

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:44.860
W-What's happening?!

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:45.930
Could it be?

00:07:45.930 --> 00:07:47.450
Poring!

00:08:01.180 --> 00:08:02.510
Sis!

00:08:02.510 --> 00:08:05.640
You've become a Priest, haven't you, Yuufa!

00:08:10.850 --> 00:08:12.450
I've returned.

00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:16.320
To save you and the others.

00:08:16.320 --> 00:08:22.390
Thank you, Yuufa-<i>san</i>. But hurry... hurry...

00:08:23.630 --> 00:08:25.030
Holy Light!

00:08:27.370 --> 00:08:32.410
Hurry... Hurry and save our souls...

00:08:32.410 --> 00:08:35.870
So that we don't kill any more people...

00:08:39.980 --> 00:08:44.390
<i>Be patient... I will save</i> <i>your souls for sure...</i>

00:08:50.190 --> 00:08:51.630
Heal!

00:08:57.670 --> 00:08:59.830
Turn Undead!

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:08.100
Sanctuary!

00:09:19.650 --> 00:09:21.590
Wow!

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:28.300
Heal!

00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:34.370
Ring the bell all you want- it won't do any good!

00:09:34.370 --> 00:09:39.360
No matter how many times you ring it,
I will save every one of their souls!

00:09:51.090 --> 00:09:53.450
This is no fun!

00:10:16.480 --> 00:10:18.010
So that's Wolyafa?!

00:10:18.010 --> 00:10:20.580
Wait!

00:10:20.580 --> 00:10:22.740
Leave this to me.

00:10:27.320 --> 00:10:28.990
So you're the one...

00:10:28.990 --> 00:10:31.930
The one who's been taking away my fun.

00:10:33.890 --> 00:10:36.190
Say something!

00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:40.460
You make me so mad!

00:10:44.970 --> 00:10:46.960
Turn Undead!

00:11:01.290 --> 00:11:02.920
Sanctuary!

00:11:10.800 --> 00:11:13.860
Why you!

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:21.210
Huh? Where'd they go?

00:11:21.210 --> 00:11:25.480
Stop playing with people's souls.

00:11:25.480 --> 00:11:30.050
Souls are precious, they're not for you to raise from the dead or kill at your whim,

00:11:30.050 --> 00:11:33.350
and they're certainly not your playthings!

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:43.730
I don't care!

00:11:43.730 --> 00:11:46.370
I only did it because it was fun.

00:11:46.370 --> 00:11:49.570
I was just playing with all of them.

00:11:49.570 --> 00:11:52.170
Maybe it was just play to you,

00:11:52.170 --> 00:11:56.680
but you hurt Sophy and the others.

00:11:56.680 --> 00:11:58.180
They were hurt?

00:11:58.180 --> 00:11:59.680
That's right.

00:11:59.680 --> 00:12:02.680
Because of me?

00:12:02.680 --> 00:12:07.050
That's right. What you did was wrong.

00:12:07.050 --> 00:12:11.030
Wrong? I don't understand...

00:12:11.030 --> 00:12:12.560
Out of my way, Yuufa!

00:12:12.560 --> 00:12:15.200
Reasoning with her won't do any good!

00:12:15.200 --> 00:12:16.130
No!

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:20.660
This child simply doesn't know the difference between right and wrong.

00:12:23.540 --> 00:12:26.570
Isn't that right, Wolyafa-<i>chan</i>?

00:12:26.570 --> 00:12:31.770
But now you know that what you've been doing was wrong, don't you?

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:38.320
I just wanted to play.

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:42.320
I was lonely all by myself.

00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:44.430
You won't be anymore.

00:12:44.430 --> 00:12:46.490
I know now what you've been feeling.

00:12:46.490 --> 00:12:52.900
But there are things you can and things you mustn't do.

00:12:52.900 --> 00:12:57.940
From now on, when you feel lonely,
I'll play with you.

00:12:57.940 --> 00:12:59.410
What?

00:12:59.410 --> 00:13:04.510
So stop playing with people's souls, okay?

00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:07.070
I'll play with you, too.

00:13:10.020 --> 00:13:12.780
W-What?

00:13:17.790 --> 00:13:19.660
Oh, all right!

00:13:21.100 --> 00:13:23.360
Satisfied?

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:28.870
All right? So don't play with souls.

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:31.910
Okay, I understand.

00:13:31.910 --> 00:13:37.410
But in exchange, you have to come and play with me.

00:13:37.410 --> 00:13:39.880
Of course I will.

00:13:42.650 --> 00:13:44.740
That makes me so happy!

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:52.330
<i>Sophy-san, is everything okay now?</i>

00:13:52.330 --> 00:13:54.850
That won't do!

00:14:09.510 --> 00:14:12.580
Takius-<i>san's sensei</i>?!

00:14:12.580 --> 00:14:19.210
I was so close... so close to the ultimate truth.

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:24.020
What're you talking about?

00:14:24.020 --> 00:14:29.490
If you won't make the monsters come back to life...

00:14:32.070 --> 00:14:38.600
You'll have to make up for them with your life, Wolyafa.

00:14:42.210 --> 00:14:44.110
I won't let you do such a thing!

00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:47.820
Right! Aren't you Takius-<i>san's sensei</i>?

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:49.440
Why would you do such a thing?

00:14:53.290 --> 00:14:56.060
What're you saying?

00:14:56.060 --> 00:14:58.860
They're monsters.

00:14:58.860 --> 00:15:04.930
You could praise me, but you have no reason to criticize me.

00:15:04.930 --> 00:15:06.870
You do have a point...

00:15:06.870 --> 00:15:08.300
Roan!

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:13.570
If you want to interfere, be my guests...

00:15:15.610 --> 00:15:20.810
You can become the foundation for the ultimate truth!

00:15:25.290 --> 00:15:27.450
Yuufa, stay behind me!

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:32.560
Meteor!

00:15:32.560 --> 00:15:35.050
Frost Diver!

00:15:43.470 --> 00:15:46.340
Stop it, <i>Sensei</i>!

00:15:46.340 --> 00:15:48.580
Takius-<i>san</i>?!

00:15:48.580 --> 00:15:53.910
<i>Sensei</i>, weren't you seeking the ultimate truth for the sake of all mankind?!

00:15:53.910 --> 00:15:59.650
I cannot understand why you must kill people for the ultimate truth!

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:06.990
Catherine!

00:16:08.460 --> 00:16:11.770
Not only won't you listen to me...

00:16:11.770 --> 00:16:16.940
Now you want to interfere, as well?

00:16:16.940 --> 00:16:20.310
I can't forgive you any longer.

00:16:21.940 --> 00:16:23.010
Look out!

00:16:23.010 --> 00:16:26.000
Sightrasher!

00:16:50.240 --> 00:16:53.300
Lord of...

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:00.580
Wolyafa-<i>chan</i>!

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:04.920
No, Yuufa! You'll be sucked in!

00:17:04.920 --> 00:17:06.490
Wolyafa-<i>chan</i>!

00:17:06.490 --> 00:17:08.320
Yuufa, use your Angel.

00:17:08.320 --> 00:17:09.660
Wolyafa-<i>chan</i>!

00:17:09.660 --> 00:17:11.660
Yuufa!

00:17:11.660 --> 00:17:14.960
...Vermillion!

00:17:24.140 --> 00:17:26.810
Nooo!

00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:28.840
This is bad...

00:17:28.840 --> 00:17:31.110
Quickly! Take cover!

00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:32.880
--Wol...
--Yuufa!

00:18:02.610 --> 00:18:04.510
--Damn!
--What has he done?!

00:18:09.620 --> 00:18:12.110
Nooo!

00:18:13.650 --> 00:18:17.520
I don't want anything to do with this sort of power!

00:18:17.520 --> 00:18:19.020
Takius-<i>san</i>?

00:18:23.030 --> 00:18:24.600
How wonderful it is!

00:18:24.600 --> 00:18:30.440
Wolyafa's soul and the monsters' strength and wisdom

00:18:30.440 --> 00:18:36.810
that formed the foundation of the ultimate truth now flow into me!

00:18:38.210 --> 00:18:43.010
At long last, I've grasped the ultimate truth!

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:47.980
Wolyafa's soul?

00:19:00.170 --> 00:19:01.970
No!

00:19:03.500 --> 00:19:05.770
You...

00:19:05.770 --> 00:19:07.440
What's the matter?

00:19:07.440 --> 00:19:11.010
Is there something you want to tell me?

00:19:11.010 --> 00:19:15.420
I would've appreciated a word of congratulations.

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:18.390
I have achieved the ultimate truth at last!

00:19:18.390 --> 00:19:23.920
A level no ordinary man could reach!

00:19:23.920 --> 00:19:28.230
Won't you celebrate with me...

00:19:28.230 --> 00:19:30.890
Catherine?

00:19:33.400 --> 00:19:35.970
Don't ever...

00:19:35.970 --> 00:19:38.340
...call me by that name!

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:55.920
You're wasting your time.

00:19:55.920 --> 00:19:59.860
Now that I have the ultimate truth, your powers are nothing.

00:20:03.500 --> 00:20:06.730
To angels, I give battle...

00:20:06.730 --> 00:20:09.770
To warriors, I give repose...

00:20:09.770 --> 00:20:12.110
And to you, my dear apprentice...

00:20:12.110 --> 00:20:15.510
I give eternal slumber.

00:20:15.510 --> 00:20:20.850
So now you think you're God?!

00:20:23.180 --> 00:20:24.480
What the-

00:20:24.480 --> 00:20:25.650
Roan-<i>san</i>!

00:20:25.650 --> 00:20:28.750
You have a long way to go.

00:20:34.630 --> 00:20:37.000
This time, I'll finish you all!

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:38.900
Arrow Shower!

00:20:38.900 --> 00:20:42.700
Huh?! Oh no!

00:20:43.840 --> 00:20:44.740
Is that?

00:20:44.740 --> 00:20:46.140
Could it be?!

00:20:46.140 --> 00:20:48.640
Who's there?

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:52.010
Man, what're you guys doin' anyway?

00:20:52.010 --> 00:20:53.310
Big Brother Iruga!

00:20:53.310 --> 00:20:55.180
Big Sis Judia!

00:20:55.180 --> 00:20:58.250
Seein' as how you're strugglin' with a weird old man,

00:20:58.250 --> 00:21:03.090
I think you need our help, after all. Right, Iruga?

00:21:03.090 --> 00:21:08.650
Really! When am I ever going to get a chance to recite my incantation?!!

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:19.870
You're really asking for it, old man!

00:21:33.350 --> 00:21:34.790
<i>Sensei...</i>

00:21:44.300 --> 00:21:49.700
Just when I thought we could be friends...

00:21:49.700 --> 00:21:51.300
I'm so sorry!

00:22:02.420 --> 00:22:07.190
<i>There are times when people</i> <i>want to turn away from reality.</i>

00:22:07.190 --> 00:22:11.720
<i>But there is only one truth.</i>
<i>We must not run from it.</i>

00:22:15.000 --> 00:22:19.170
<i>There are times when our hearts</i> <i>are controlled by darkness.</i>

00:22:19.170 --> 00:22:24.630
<i>But it is we humans</i> <i>who can correct those wrongs.</i>

00:22:25.640 --> 00:22:27.670
<i>I will do it...</i>

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:44.910
<i>Unable to even find a way</i> <i>to regain the strength we lost</i>

00:22:45.890 --> 00:22:54.000
<i>Here we are, beneath this vast sky</i>

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:58.840
<i>The shining cradle of green</i>

00:22:58.840 --> 00:23:03.710
<i>Is a merry-go-round</i> <i>that will never stop turning</i>

00:23:03.710 --> 00:23:08.480
<i>Greater than any jewel in this world</i>

00:23:08.480 --> 00:23:12.820
<i>It is a precious treasure</i>

00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:22.820
<i>The endless journey leads to our tomorrow</i>

00:23:31.270 --> 00:23:33.310
<i>Hi! This is W.</i>

00:23:33.310 --> 00:23:36.480
<i>Roan and his group arrive in</i>
<i>Alberta on their way to Comodo.</i>

00:23:36.480 --> 00:23:40.110
<i>But there, something...</i>
<i>I can't say anymore!</i>

00:23:40.110 --> 00:23:42.150
<i>Next time,</i> "We'll Always Be Together."

00:23:42.150 --> 00:23:44.980
<i>Get your handkerchiefs ready, everybody.</i>
